2,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.Bound.c","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Search.lean#L142-L142"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Search.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.Bound.val\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cutsat</span>.<span class=\"name\">Bound</span>.<span class=\"name\">val</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Search.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.Bound\">Bound</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Rat/Basic.html#Rat\">Rat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Search.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.Bound.val","kind":"def","line":141,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.Bound.val","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Search.lean#L141-L141"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Search.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.Bound.mk\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cutsat</span>.<span class=\"name\">Bound</span>.<span class=\"name\">mk</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Rat/Basic.html#Rat\">Rat</a> →\n  <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.LeCnstr\">Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.LeCnstr</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Rat/Basic.html#Rat\">Rat</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.LeCnstr\">Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.LeCnstr</a> → <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Search.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.Bound\">Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.Bound</a></span></span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Search.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.Bound.mk","kind":"ctor","line":134,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.Bound.mk","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Search.lean#L134-L144"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">structure</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Search.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.Bound\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cutsat</span>.<span class=\"name\">Bound</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Best bound for a variable. `val` and `c` use all divisibility constraints for tightening,\n`val₀` and `c₀` only those that do not depend on decisions. Conflicts are explained with\n`c₀` whenever possible, so that they do not depend on the current case: the untightened bound\noften refutes all cases of a Cooper split at once.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Search.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.Bound","kind":"structure","line":134,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.Bound","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Search.lean#L134-L144"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Search.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.tightUsingDvds\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cutsat</span>.<span class=\"name\">tightUsingDvds</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.LeCnstr\">LeCnstr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">decFreeOnly</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/SearchM.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.SearchM\">SearchM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.LeCnstr\">LeCnstr</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Tightens `c` using the divisibility constraints of the variables occurring in `c.p`.\nFor a variable `z` with coefficient `a` in `c.p` and constraint `d ∣ p'` where `p'` has leading\ncoefficient `±1` on `z`, let `r := c.p - t*p'` with `t := a / (±1)`, and `g` be the gcd of `d`\nand the variable coefficients of `r`. If `g > 1`, the value of `c.p` is congruent to the constant\nof `r` modulo `g`, and `c.p ≤ 0` can be strengthened to the largest such value `≤ 0`.\nExample: `32768 ∣ x` and `-x + 32768*q + 1 ≤ 0` give `-x + 32768*q + 32768 ≤ 0`.\n\nIf `decFreeOnly := true`, only the divisibility constraints of the state saved at the first case\nsplit are used. They do not depend on decisions, so neither does the result.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Search.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.tightUsingDvds","kind":"def","line":92,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.tightUsingDvds","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Search.lean#L92-L132"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Search.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.CooperSplit.assert\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cutsat</span>.<span class=\"name\">CooperSplit</span>.<span class=\"name\">assert</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">cs</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.CooperSplit\">CooperSplit</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GoalM\">GoalM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Asserts constraints implied by a `CooperSplit`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Search.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.CooperSplit.assert","kind":"def","line":17,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.CooperSplit.assert","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Search.lean#L17-L52"}}],"imports":["Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.DvdCnstr","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.Proof","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.ReorderVars","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.SearchM","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.Util","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Simp.Arith.Int.Simp"],"instances":[{"className":"Inhabited","name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.instInhabitedFindIntValResult","typeNames":["Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.FindIntValResult"]}],"name":"Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.Search"}